   "stem": {
      "text": "Let \\( f(x) = e^{-x} \\). The second-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( f \\) about \\( x = 0 \\) is used to approximate \\( f\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\). Find the Lagrange error bound for this approximation, taking \\( M \\) to be the maximum of \\( |f'''(x)| \\) on \\( \\left[- \\frac{1}{2}, 0\\right] \\)."
   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "symbolic",
