         ],
         48
      ]
   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "A degree 2 polynomial needs the derivative of order 3: \\( f'''(x) = - e^{- x} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Negate",
            [
               "Exp",
               [
                  "Negate",
                  "x"
               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Its absolute value is monotonic on \\( \\left[- \\frac{1}{2}, 0\\right] \\), so the maximum is at an endpoint: \\( M = e^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\). The bound is \\( \\frac{M\\,|x - 0|^{3}}{3!} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Exp",
