               1,
               2
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "With \\( |x - 0| = \\frac{1}{2} \\), the bound is \\( \\frac{e^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{3}}{6} = \\frac{e^{\\frac{1}{2}}}{48} \\).",
